      <div type="layout" source="#source-439126-439248" style="padding-inline-end: 2em; text-align: right">
        <p><hi rend="font-size small(1)" snh:layout-kind="font-size" snh:layout-params="size-type=small;level=1" source="#source-439156-439246"><seg source="#source-439189-439213">寺町通五条上ル町</seg></hi></p>
